\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces End-to-end architecture of OUEG-RAG. (Sec.\nobreakspace  {}3.1\hbox {}) Multi-Source Evidence Ingestion retrieves relevant table rows and candidate hyperlink passages. (Sec.\nobreakspace  {}3.2\hbox {}) Schema-Preserving Multigraph Construction instantiates star centroids $\rho _i$ and deterministic text relations ($<20$\tmspace  +\thinmuskip {.1667em}ms). (Sec.\nobreakspace  {}3.3\hbox {}) Two-Tier Controlled Reasoning Engine: Tier\nobreakspace  {}1 evaluates the lossless compressed multigraph with guided reading path $p_1$; confident outputs yield an immediate verified span (Fast Exit, 1 call), while ambiguous candidate collisions or missing links emit a diagnostic handoff ($\mathcal  {H}_{\text  {diag}}$) triggering targeted symmetric bridge retrieval and minimal L2 state capsule evaluation. (Sec.\nobreakspace  {}3.4\hbox {}) Grounded Generation and Provenance Audit produces verified spans with full auditable attribution and closed-loop reverse grounding.}}{6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{2}{6}}
